"language","unknown","fast|RAG enterprise market conversational memory AI agents retrieval augmented generation 2026\n",{},{"_141":469,"_148":536,"_54":537,"_152":538,"_154":155,"_157":158,"_159":539,"_161":450},"92997263-f456-4bcf-a71a-095a74422492",[500],{"_199":200,"_159":547},1788541183.3126926,{"_194":528,"_529":530,"_195":546},{"_168":540,"_170":541,"_174":109,"_506":542,"_508":543,"_427":448,"_451":544,"_430":431,"_177":178,"_179":233,"_181":182,"_183":234,"_185":234,"_186":109,"_66":67,"_188":545,"_189":10,"_187":14},[],[],[543],"Searching the web",[525],"72b46336-d02e-48c9-8929-bea23f041aef","search(\"how will you rate this project out of 10 in context of market \")",{},{"_141":534,"_148":551,"_54":552,"_152":553,"_154":155,"_157":158,"_159":554,"_161":200},"bd8f6d23-3574-43f1-b6a3-d0436c3c7ce0",[469],{"_199":560,"_159":561},1788541183.3160722,{"_194":195,"_196":559},{"_555":34,"_168":556,"_170":557,"_172":558,"_174":109,"_177":178,"_179":233,"_181":182,"_183":234,"_185":234,"_186":109,"_66":67,"_188":549,"_189":10,"_187":14},"is_visually_hidden_from_conversation",[],[],[],[358],"system",{},{"_141":549,"_148":565,"_54":566,"_56":567,"_152":568,"_154":155,"_157":158,"_159":569,"_161":162},"30bda0a6-9726-4911-9fbf-6c67f66fd1d2",[534],{"_199":217,"_159":574},1788541183.464,1788541188.214043,{"_194":195,"_196":572},{"_210":570,"_179":233,"_212":-5,"_183":234,"_185":234,"_189":10,"_187":14},{"_213":571},[],[573],"how will you rate this project out of 10 in context of market ",{},{"_141":563,"_148":578,"_54":579,"_56":580,"_152":581,"_154":155,"_156":34,"_157":158,"_159":582,"_161":162,"_163":164},"6416a3a2-fd24-4de4-bb10-9952aa1177e9",[549],{"_199":200,"_159":593},1788541110.922371,1788541114.401112,{"_194":195,"_196":591},{"_165":583,"_167":34,"_168":584,"_170":585,"_172":586,"_174":109,"_175":587,"_177":178,"_179":588,"_181":182,"_183":589,"_185":589,"_186":109,"_66":67,"_187":34,"_188":576,"_189":10},{"_50":190,"_191":590},[],[],[],[],"700f0a5d-0f3f-46a6-a209-50ccbc20d4d5","f3f14b99-8463-4e27-90ae-2273dd988981",[193],[592],"Yes, this is a logical next step. After retrieval, you can pass the retrieved chat information to an LLM whose job is to organize and refine the raw retrieved content rather than generate completely new information. The LLM can identify important conversations, user preferences, decisions, requirements, and relevant context, remove unnecessary repetition, and structure everything into a clean document. After this processing, the final structured output can be passed to your PDF generation tool, which creates a downloadable document containing the old agent's conversation knowledge. Your overall pipeline would therefore be: Public Chat Link → Chat Extraction → Cleaning/Parsing → Chunking → Embeddings → Vector Database → Retrieval → LLM Processing/Structuring → Final Document → PDF Generation. One important point is that you should instruct the LLM to preserve the original information and not hallucinate missing details, because the purpose of your system is to transfer existing conversation knowledge accurately.",{},{"_141":576,"_148":597,"_54":598,"_56":599,"_152":600,"_154":155,"_157":158,"_159":601,"_161":162},"4d216ce9-ff9c-4465-8ff3-b868db5001f9",[563],{"_199":217,"_159":606},1788541110.84,1788541115.439061,{"_194":195,"_196":604},{"_210":602,"_179":588,"_212":-5,"_183":589,"_185":589,"_189":10,"_187":14},{"_213":603},[],[605],"i have done till retrieval of the chats now next process is intergrating llm which beautify retreival output and then using pdf tool to create a pdf of that output ",{},{"_141":595,"_148":610,"_54":611,"_56":612,"_152":613,"_154":155,"_156":34,"_157":158,"_159":614,"_161":162,"_163":164},"90d60177-ab34-4879-a32e-3994070670dc",[576],{"_199":200,"_159":625},1788541046.115462,1788541052.516594,{"_194":195,"_196":623},{"_165":615,"_167":34,"_168":616,"_170":617,"_172":618,"_174":109,"_175":619,"_177":178,"_179":620,"_181":182,"_183":621,"_185":621,"_186":109,"_66":67,"_187":34,"_188":608,"_189":10},{"_50":190,"_191":622},[],[],[],[],"2aa41773-48a1-4338-a883-62a16693d619","0962edb3-93db-4716-9ed5-a78c2323c5e4",[193],[624],"Your project is a very good and practical application of RAG because it focuses on transferring the knowledge and conversational context of an old AI agent to a new agent. The basic idea is that the user provides a public chat link, your system extracts the conversation data, converts it into a structured document, and then processes that document into chunks and embeddings. When the document is provided to a new agent, the RAG system retrieves relevant information from the previous conversations whenever the new agent receives a query. This allows the new agent to understand the user's previous discussions, preferences, decisions, and context, making its responses more consistent with the old agent. However, I would describe the project as \"conversation knowledge transfer\" rather than literally making the new agent become the old agent, because RAG provides the old agent's accessible knowledge and context but does not transfer its underlying model weights, reasoning behavior, or hidden memory. Overall, the project has strong potential because it demonstrates web data extraction, document processing, embeddings, vector databases, semantic retrieval, and LLM generation in one complete system.",{},{"_141":608,"_148":629,"_54":630,"_56":631,"_152":632,"_154":155,"_157":158,"_159":633,"_161":162},"a5631392-764b-4847-b5cc-227da6092e19",[595],{"_199":217,"_159":638},1788541046.113,1788541052.515853,{"_194":195,"_196":636},{"_210":634,"_179":620,"_212":-5,"_183":621,"_185":621,"_189":10,"_187":14},{"_213":635},[],[637],"i am making a project related to rag where user will enter its public chat link and he gets document. if that document send to new agent he will learn all past chat data and behave like old agent . how is this project ? . answer in only para and text format",{},{"_141":627,"_148":642,"_54":643,"_56":644,"_152